  "solution": {
    "text": "The numbers are <math><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn></math><br />Mean,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>41</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4592</mn><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the variance is <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2296</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1764</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>532</mn></math>",
